<p>When the data set is small, the speed improvement using the skip list is=
n=E2=80=99t obvious. Figure 10 shows an example of a skip list with 5 level=
s of indexes. In the base linked list, it needs to travel 62 nodes to reach=
 the correct node. In the skip list, it only needs to traverse 11 nodes [2]=
.</p>
