, 16383].  The primary node in each shard is responsible for handling write=
s, and the replicas provide read availability and redundancy.  Arrows indic=
ate the flow of data: from the Client to the Proxy, and from the Proxy to t=
he appropriate primary node within the relevant shard.  The label 'Redis Cl=
