<p>An update would simply change the score of the user in the corresponding=
 shard (determined by <em>CRC16(key)%16384</em>). Retrieving the top 10 pla=
yers on the leaderboard is more complicated. We need to gather the top 10 p=
layers from each shard and have the application sort the data. A concrete e=
xample is shown in Figure 20. Those queries can be parallelized to reduce l=
atency.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a data processing pipeline using a scatter-=
