e' and 'user_id'. The 'gather' operation implies that the data from the thr=
ee source tables are combined, and then sorted by the 'score' column to pro=
duce the final top 10 leaderboard.  The final leaderboard shows the top 10 =
users based on their scores, aggregated from the three partitions." loading=
=3D"lazy" width=3D"650" height=3D"484" decoding=3D"async" data-nimg=3D"1" s=
